 class=3D"hckui__typography__bodyL"></p><p></p><span>Designing for Accessib=
ility</span></h3><p class=3D"hckui__typography__bodyL">Furthermore, there i=
s another crucial motivation behind this project.</p><p class=3D"hckui__typ=
ography__bodyL">I have been involved in developing IoT devices for the hear=
ing impaired. Most household appliances rely on auditory cues (like a loud =
beep) to signal completion. This design is not accessible, and I have heard=
 many complaints from the deaf and hard-of-hearing community.</p><p class=
=3D"hckui__typography__bodyL">I wanted to create a mechanism that not only =
eliminates inconvenience for the general public but also provides a simple,=
 visual, and reliable smartphone alert system to assist those with hearing =
loss in their daily lives.</p><p class=3D"hckui__typography__bodyL"><br></p=
><h3 class=3D"hckui__typography__h3 title-with-anchor" id=3D"toc-the-soluti=
on--washer-sense-3"><p></p><p class=3D"hckui__typography__bodyL"></p><p></p=
><span>The Solution: Washer-Sense</span></h3><p class=3D"hckui__typography_=
_bodyL"><strong>Washer-Sense</strong><span> is a retrofitted, low-cost IoT =
add-on.</span></p><p class=3D"hckui__typography__bodyL"><span>By simply att=
aching an </span><strong>M5StickC Plus2</strong><span> to the exterior of y=
our washing machine, it detects physical vibrations and sends a real-time n=
otification to your smartphone via Discord when the cycle completes.</span>=
</p><p class=3D"hckui__typography__bodyL"><span>=E2=97=8F </span><strong>Ze=
ro-Invasive:</strong><span> No tools, wiring modifications, or disassembly =
required.</span></p><p class=3D"hckui__typography__bodyL"><span>=E2=97=8F <=
/span><strong>Easy Setup:</strong><span> Just stick it on and power it up.<=
/span></p><h3 class=3D"hckui__typography__h3 title-with-anchor" id=3D"toc-w=
hat-makes-this-project-special-4"><p></p><p class=3D"hckui__typography__bod=
yL"></p><p></p><span>What Makes This Project Special</span></h3><p class=3D=
"hckui__typography__bodyL"><span>While there are many DIY laundry monitors,=
 </span><strong>Washer-Sense</strong><span> stands out due to its practical=
, real-world design focus:</span></p><p class=3D"hckui__typography__bodyL">=
