<div class=3D"hckui__typography__bodyS hckui__typography__pebble">What is i=
t?<br>Washer-Sense is an IoT retrofit kit that transforms any traditional w=
ashing machine into a smart appliance. It uses high-sensitivity vibration t=
racking (with peak-hold and a 10x software amplifier) to accurately determi=
ne the machine's exact state (CHECKING, WASHING, PAUSED, FINISHED).<br><br>=
How do you use it?<br>Simply attach the M5Stack unit to your washing machin=
e. It requires no complex wiring. Press the "A" button to auto-calibrate th=
e baseline noise for your specific machine. Once running, it monitors the v=
ibrations and sends real-time push notifications to your smartphone via Web=
hooks (e.g., Make.com) when the laundry starts, pauses, or finishes.</div><=
/div></div><div class=3D"actions"><button class=3D"hckui__buttons__md hckui=
